{
  "_comment": "GitHub #66: shared cases for the rich feedback of the pool JSON format (RichFeedbackFormat.php, src/utils/richFeedback.js). PHPUnit: RichFeedbackFormatTest, PoolExportRoundTripTest. Vitest: richFeedback.test.js. Generic content only.",
  "cases": [
